      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jamestown%2C_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first Africans in English North America arrived aboard the White Lion in 1619, later known as Antoney and Isabella.",
